<section class="review-section" id="overview">
<h2><svg class="neon-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2"></path><rect height="4" rx="1" ry="1" width="8" x="8" y="2"></rect></svg> Overview</h2>
<p>Finch 3D is an AI-powered design optimization platform that integrates seamlessly with Grasshopper, the parametric design plugin for Rhino. Launched in 2020, Finch brings generative design and real-time optimization to architects who work in computational design workflows.</p>
<p>Unlike traditional AI design tools that generate entire floor plans from scratch, Finch 3D focuses on optimization. You define the constraints, objectives, and design space—then Finch's algorithms explore thousands of design variations to find optimal solutions based on your criteria. This makes it ideal for data-driven design decisions.</p>
<p>With over 20,000 users worldwide, Finch 3D has become a favorite among architects who value performance metrics like daylight access, ventilation quality, and construction costs. The platform provides instant feedback, allowing designers to understand the impact of their decisions in real-time.</p>
<div class="finch-highlight">
<h4><svg class="neon-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="6"></circle><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2"></circle></svg> Generative Optimization</h4>
<p style="margin: 0;">Finch doesn't just generate designs—it optimizes them. Set multiple objectives (daylight, cost, efficiency) and watch AI find the perfect balance between competing goals.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section class="review-section" id="features">
<h2><svg class="neon-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"></polygon></svg> Key Features</h2>
<div class="features-grid">
<div class="feature-card"><h4>🧬 Generative Design</h4><p>AI explores thousands of design variations based on your parameters. Discover solutions you might never have considered manually.</p></div>
<div class="feature-card"><h4><svg class="neon-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><line x1="18" x2="18" y1="20" y2="10"></line><line x1="12" x2="12" y1="20" y2="4"></line><line x1="6" x2="6" y1="20" y2="14"></line></svg> Mass Optimization</h4><p>Optimize building massing for multiple criteria simultaneously—solar exposure, views, floor area ratio, and more.</p></div>
<div class="feature-card"><h4>☀️ Daylight Analysis</h4><p>Real-time daylight simulation and optimization. Maximize natural light while minimizing glare and heat gain.</p></div>
<div class="feature-card"><h4>💨 Ventilation Simulation</h4><p>CFD-based natural ventilation analysis. Optimize window placement and building orientation for airflow efficiency.</p></div>
<div class="feature-card"><h4><svg class="neon-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><line x1="12" x2="12" y1="1" y2="23"></line><path d="M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 000 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 010 7H6"></path></svg> Cost Analysis</h4><p>Estimate construction costs in real-time based on material quantities and building geometry. Make informed budget decisions early.</p></div>
<div class="feature-card"><h4><svg class="neon-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="6"></circle><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2"></circle></svg> Multi-Objective Optimization</h4><p>Balance competing design goals using advanced algorithms. Find Pareto-optimal solutions that maximize overall performance.</p></div>
<div class="feature-card"><h4><svg class="neon-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><rect x="7" y="7" width="10" height="12" rx="1"/><path d="M9 1v3M15 1v3M9 20v3M15 20v3"/></svg> Parametric Workflows</h4><p>Deep Grasshopper integration means Finch works within your existing computational design process. No workflow disruption.</p></div>
<div class="feature-card"><h4><svg class="neon-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><polygon points="13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2"></polygon></svg> Instant Feedback</h4><p>See performance metrics update in real-time as you adjust parameters. Understand cause-and-effect immediately.</p></div>
</div>
</section>
